"description":
"Rat Achilles: a long PRE rest/sleep epoch in the home cage, a novel MAZE epoch running on a wooden 1.6 m linear platform, water-rewarded at both ends ('1.6m Linear Maze') in a novel room, then a long POST rest/sleep epoch in the home cage, with LFP and units from two silicon probes in the CA1 pyramidal layer of both hemispheres, neck EMG and a head-mounted accelerometer. The three recordings were concatenated by the lab, so all times are seconds into the concatenated recording. The session start time is the start of the PRE recording, from its Amplipex .meta file.",
