"description":
"Rat Gatsby: a long PRE rest/sleep epoch in the home cage, a novel MAZE epoch running on a wooden 1.6 m linear platform, water-rewarded at both ends ('1.6m Linear Maze') in a novel room, then a long POST rest/sleep epoch in the home cage, with LFP and units from two silicon probes in the CA1 pyramidal layer of both hemispheres, neck EMG and a head-mounted accelerometer. The three recordings were concatenated by the lab, so all times are seconds into the concatenated recording. The time of day the session started is not recorded; the start time is midnight of the session date.",
